Description: XLibre X server -- dummy display driver
 This package provides a 'dummy' display driver, which does not actually
 display anything.
 .
 More information about XLibre can be found at:
 <URL:https://www.github.com/X11Libre/xserver>
 .
 This package is built from the XLibre xf86-video-dummy driver module.
